cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Datumfold, please cite this software."
title: "Datumfold: photos into editable CAD"
type: software
version: 0.5.0
date-released: 2026-08-13
authors:
  - name: "DA3-CAD contributors"
repository-code: "https://github.com/dancher00/DA3-CAD"
url: "https://github.com/dancher00/DA3-CAD"
license: Apache-2.0
abstract: >-
  DA3-CAD converts object-centric multi-view RGB images or moving-camera video
  into validated editable CadQuery, STEP, and STL using Depth Anything 3
  geometry and a deterministic, class-free sketch-and-operation CAD grammar
  with evidence-gated feature recovery.
keywords:
  - computer-aided design
  - 3D reconstruction
  - Depth Anything 3
  - B-Rep
  - CAD grammar
